        ],
        [
          1085.129,
          901.949,
          null,
          null
        ]
      ],
      "style": {
        "size": "m",
        "color": "black",
        "opacity": 1.0
      },
      "meta": {
        "author": "human",
        "text": "Why rural areas are cooler\nPlants use evapotranspiration — releasing water vapor that cools the air.Urban grey infrastructure does not have this cooling effect.\nThree mitigation strategies\nCool Roofs\nMechanism: Increase albedo with reflective paint.\nChallenge: May cause glare to nearby buildings.\nPermeable Pavement\nMechanism: Cool through water evaporation from underlying soil.\nChallenge: Lower structural load capacity.\nGreen Infrastructure\nMechanism: Provides shade and evapotranspiration.\nChallenge: High maintenance and water needs.",
        "summary": "",
        "role": "body",
        "fontFamily": "sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": "400",
        "fontSize": 18,
        "growDir": "right-down",
        "baseWidth": 576,
        "baseHeight": 576,
        "configuredWidth": 576,
        "configuredHeight": 576,
        "lineHeight": 1.4,
        "padding": 0,
        "contentWidth": 413.1289062499999,
        "contentHeight": 403.2,
        "lineCount": 16,
        "renderedText": "Why rural areas are cooler\nPlants use evapotranspiration — releasing water\nvapor that cools the air.Urban grey infrastructure\ndoes not have this cooling effect.\nThree mitigation strategies\nCool Roofs\nMechanism: Increase albedo with reflective paint.\nChallenge: May cause glare to nearby buildings.\nPermeable Pavement\nMechanism: Cool through water evaporation\nfrom underlying soil.\nChallenge: Lower structural load capacity.\nGreen Infrastructure\nMechanism: Provides shade and\nevapotranspiration.\nChallenge: High maintenance and water needs."
      }
    },
