      "meta": {
        "author": "human",
        "text": "Feature\tCool Roofs\tGreen Roofs\nCooling Mechanism\tHigh albedo → reflects solar radiation\tShade + evapotranspiration → cools through water\nHeat Reduction\tStrong daytime reduction\tStrong daytime + better nighttime cooling\nWater Need\tVery low\tHigh (needs irrigation)\nMaintenance\tLow\tHigh (soil, plants, drainage)\nInsulation\tModerate\tExcellent (thermal mass + insulation)\nCost\tLow–medium\tHigh (structure, soil, plants)",
        "summary": "",
        "role": "subtitle",
        "fontFamily": "sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": "600",
        "fontSize": 24,
        "growDir": "right-down",
        "baseWidth": 480,
        "baseHeight": 192,
        "configuredWidth": 480,
        "configuredHeight": 192,
        "lineHeight": 1.4,
        "padding": 0,
        "contentWidth": 480,
        "contentHeight": 537.5999999999999,
        "lineCount": 16,
        "renderedText": "Feature Cool Roofs Green Roofs\nCooling Mechanism High albedo →\nreflects solar radiation Shade +\nevapotranspiration → cools through\nwater\nHeat Reduction Strong daytime\nreduction Strong daytime + better\nnighttime cooling\nWater Need Very low High (needs\nirrigation)\nMaintenance Low High (soil, plants,\ndrainage)\nInsulation Moderate Excellent (thermal\nmass + insulation)\nCost Low–medium High (structure, soil,\nplants)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_mmum84h6_jedu",
      "tool": "text",
      "points": [
        [
          2656.0,
