        ]
      ],
      "style": {
        "size": "m",
        "color": "black",
        "opacity": 1.0
      },
      "meta": {
        "author": "human",
        "text": " Desert City (hot, dry, scarce water)\nBetter choice: Cool Roofs\nDesert has intense sun but little water.\nCool roofs reflect heat without using water.\nGreen roofs need too much irrigation and are hard to maintain.\n🌴 Tropical City (hot, humid, rainy)\nBetter choice: Green Roofs\nHigh humidity makes reflection less effective alone.\nEvapotranspiration works well with natural rainfall.\nGreen roofs also improve stormwater management and insulation.",
        "summary": "",
        "role": "body",
        "fontFamily": "sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": "400",
        "fontSize": 18,
        "growDir": "right-down",
        "baseWidth": 512,
