        "lineHeight": 1.4,
        "padding": 0,
        "contentWidth": 429.1015625,
        "contentHeight": 302.4,
        "lineCount": 12,
        "renderedText": "Desert City (hot, dry, scarce water)\nBetter choice: Cool Roofs\nDesert has intense sun but little water.\nCool roofs reflect heat without using water.\nGreen roofs need too much irrigation and are hard\nto maintain.\n🌴 Tropical City (hot, humid, rainy)\nBetter choice: Green Roofs\nHigh humidity makes reflection less effective alone.\nEvapotranspiration works well with natural rainfall.\nGreen roofs also improve stormwater management\nand insulation."
      }
